> Hi guys
>
>   I am trying to load dataset of 50 cel files using   ReadAffy in my machine
>
>
> It runs win XP and I'm using R Version 2.3.1
>
> Each  cel file is about 13 mb  so estimated memory usage is at most 800 mb
> I have 2G available
