This highlights the looping issue:  When using the biomaRt package in 
web service mode we should try not to loop over vectors of identifiers 
to annotate them but query for the annotation of all these identifiers 
at once. Alternatively if you can't resist to loop, one should use 
biomaRt in RMySQL mode.

best,
Steffen

